# Astro Component Patterns for Tater Talk

## Component Structure
```astro
---
// TypeScript frontmatter for props and logic
export interface Props {
  title: string;
  description?: string;
}

const { title, description } = Astro.props;
---

<!-- HTML template with Tailwind classes -->
<section class="py-24 relative">
  <!-- Content here -->
</section>

<style>
  /* Component-specific styles if needed */
</style>
```

## Import Conventions
- Use double quotes for consistency: `import Component from "../path/Component.astro";`
- Import order: Layout components, then sections, then UI components
- No need to import global.css in individual components (handled by Layout)

## Section Components Pattern
All major sections ([Hero](mdc:src/components/sections/Hero.astro), [Features](mdc:src/components/sections/Features.astro), etc.) follow:
- `id` attribute for navigation anchors
- `py-24 relative` classes for consistent spacing
- Background decorative elements with low opacity
- Responsive container: `max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8`

## Animation Implementation
- Use CSS custom animations defined in [global.css](mdc:src/styles/global.css)
- Combine with Tailwind utilities: `animate-pulse`, `hover:scale-105`
- Stagger animations with `style="animation-delay: 0.5s;"`
- Prefer CSS animations over JavaScript for performance

## Responsive Design
- Mobile-first approach with Tailwind breakpoints
- Grid layouts: `grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4`
- Text sizing: `text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl`
- Spacing adjustments: `space-x-4 sm:space-x-6 lg:space-x-8`